{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123207","id":4446659889,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCQqlMQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123207","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123207.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123207.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123207","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123207/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123207/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123207/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/575be61538a045fb0721d8664a22459725368231","number":123207,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Improve handling of Inner Classes in the Connections Dock","user":{"login":"ArchieVillain","id":168238968,"node_id":"U_kgDOCgcfeA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168238968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchieVillain","html_url":"https://github.com/ArchieVillain","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchieVillain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchieVillain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchieVillain/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchieVillain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchieVillain/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchieVillain/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchieVillain/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchieVillain/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchieVillain/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nIt improves the functionality of the Connections Dock in relation to Inner Classes.\r\n\r\n- Closes #123104. When fetching the script's icon to display in the tree, the function attempts to load the script from the provided path. However, inner classes do not appear to have entries in the path cache (presumably because their path overlaps with the outer class), causing the error. A simple empty path check fixes this.\r\n- Fixes the display of inner classes in the connections tree. Paths do not have global names or a path, so the connections dock didn't know how to identify them. This is fixed by using the `get_doc_class_name()` function, which was introduced after this specific piece of logic was first written.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nBefore the fix: tree sections lack the class name and tooltips are empty.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1062\" height=\"781\" alt=\"fix-before\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ec2ef660-d1ce-4aac-88be-0df7f1fb6b6b\" />\r\n\r\nAfter the fix: doc data is displayed correctly.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1044\" height=\"731\" alt=\"fix-after\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0b5e64b0-b0a9-4072-9a6c-b0663bdd2789\" />\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":